Architecture (mirrors the merged predecessor 0078 BulkActionsToolbar conventions exactly):
  Adapter    — pure core (Foundation only): DateTimeValue (web `string|Date|null`), DateTimeVariant
               (full/date/time/relative/short), TimeZoneMode (vehicle/user/utc), DateTimeFormatContext,
               DateTimeFormatting (the 5 formatters + resolveTimeZone + resolveLocale + isoTitle +
               DST-aware abbreviation), DateTimeAccessibility. Verbatim port of web/src/lib/dateFormat.ts
               + timezone.ts + locale.ts.
  Projection — pure DateTimeInput → DateTimeResolved (phase + display + abbrev + isoTitle + a11y); web
               render branches + P4 leaf contract; plus the `pure(...)` web-PureDateTime path.
  Model      — @Observable state-holder (P1/S8), telemetry seam (P1/S11 view.opened), connection axis,
               one-shot stale auto-refresh, DateTimeStrings i18n facade (P1/S10).
  Seams      — DateTimeSource protocol + LiveDateTimeSource + InMemoryDateTimeSource.
  Views/States/swift — value label (+ tz chip + ISO pointer-help/VoiceOver hint), freshness chip,
               loading skeleton, QueryError-peer error tile; the main `DateTime` (provider path, all
               states) + `PureDateTimeView` (web hook-free path).

Data sources bound via the shared P1/S8 seam (no HTTP in the view): useSelectedVehicle (vehicle tz),
useSettings (locale, tz_display_default, timezone_user), useTimezone (resolved IANA). No direct `Shared`
import in the surface — bound behind DateTimeSource, so it compiles + tests in isolation.

